==English==

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|UK}} {{IPA|/dɪˈvɪzɪbɪlɪti/|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|~|divisibilities}}

# {{context|uncountable|lang=en}} The state of being [[divisible]]. The state capable of being [[divide]]d.
# {{context|arithmetic|lang=en}} The property of being divisible by a particular [[integer]].

====Related terms====
*[[divide]]
*[[divisible]]

====Antonyms====
*[[combinability]]（state capable of being combined）
*[[mergeability]]（state capable of being merged）
*[[indivisibility]]（state incapable of being divided）

